      },
      {
        "version": "V5",
        "parts": "No look-ahead test in reasoning, chess, Sokoban or other tasks."
      },
      {
        "version": "V6",
        "parts": "No measure of plan depth or of whether a plan steers generation."
      }
    ],
    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The record's T4/uses_without_test call is correct. Rows r17–r20 duplicate r1–r4. The paper's 'anticipatory' framing is about harm-onset forecasting at a 16-token horizon. At most it is loosely adjacent to V2, but it does not measure token predictability, so all rows stay unlinked. The paper is a preprint, and code is not released."
  },
